{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scgpt RNA encoder in a multiprofile setup with avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.530 and F1 of 0.515, lower than the scvi_n200 encoder's 0.650 accuracy in the same configuration. The results suggest the RNA encoder choice may influence performance, but without direct comparison to other encoders or aggregation strategies, its exact contribution remains uncertain. The role of image modality and alternative fusion methods is not evaluated in this RNA-only setup."
}

